19:53:14Z"},"body":"- For #16207 \r\n\r\n### Additional details\r\n<!-- Examples:\r\n- Why was this change necessary?\r\n- What is affected by this change?\r\n- Any implementation details to explain?\r\n-->\r\n\r\n- Initial PR to move the e2e tests to system tests, to decrease the chances for merge conflicts on the rest of the work for #16207\r\n- Creates a `@tooling/system-tests` package (currently at `/system-tests` but may move to `/tooling/system-tests`)\r\n\t- Before: `yarn workspace @packages/server test-e2e foo_spec`\r\n\t- After: `yarn workspace @tooling/system-tests test foo_spec`\r\n- Moved the e2e tests and snapshots to that package\r\n- Discovered that a lot of tests were failing snapshot checks and still passing: https://app.circleci.com/pipelines/github/cypress-io/cypress/24784/workflows/96ac48fc-bda7-439b-870b-8984f2de6a59/jobs/924253/steps\r\n\t- ~~4531644 appears to have fixed this somehow~~\r\n\t\t- this is because it removed the erroneous implementation of the fix for `allowDuplicate`.\r\n\t\t- I fixed the patch up properly in 946803e and this appears to let ALL snapshots properly validate again, even ones using `allowDuplicate`\r\n\t- this is why there are snapshot/test updates for some tests\r\n\t- opened #18485 to resolve legitimate `non_root_read_only_fs_spec` failure\r\n- In the interest of getting this in `develop`, two issues have been created to explore the 2 test suites that are still having issues:\r\n\t- error_ui_spec cypress-io/cypress#18497\r\n\t- studio_spec cypress-io/cypress#18498\r\n\r\n### PR Tasks\r\n<!-- These tasks must be completed before a PR is merged.\r\nDelete tasks if they are not applicable. -->\r\n\r\n- [x] Have tests been added/updated?\r\n- [na] Has the original issue or this PR been tagged with a release in ZenHub? <!-- (internal team only)-->\r\n- [na] Has a PR for user-facing changes been opened in [`cypress-documentation`](https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress-documentation)? <!-- Link to PR here -->\r\n- [na] Have API changes been updated in the [`type definitions`](https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/blob/develop/cli/types/cypress.d.ts)?\r\n- [na] Have new configuration options been added to the [`cypress.schema.json`](https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/blob/develop/cli/schema/cypress.schema.json)?\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/issues/16354/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/issues/16354/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":5464537856,"node_id":"REFE_lADOAeKht849JAYnzwAAAAFFtjsA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/issues/events/5464537856","actor":{"login":"elevatebart","id":5592465,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTI0NjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5592465?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elevatebart","html_url":"https://github.com/elevatebart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elevatebart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elevatebart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elevatebart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elevatebart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elevatebart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elevatebart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elevatebart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elevatebart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elevatebart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"6889b11d4867562ca54c90659200af355835b086","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/commits/6889b11d4867562ca54c90659200af355835b086","created_at":"2021-10-14T15:07:2